WEBVTT

00:00.911 --> 00:09.565
Hi, my name is Nicholas Maloney and welcome to Aurate, a tool that helps teachers and speech pathologists create interactive phonon learning activities.

00:10.169 --> 00:13.375
currently choose between 2, Wordle or Word Search.

00:13.455 --> 00:14.817
Let's go check out Wordle.

00:15.218 --> 00:21.788
Here you can select from 5 different words, three different difficulties and enable or disable hints.

00:22.189 --> 00:32.606
Currently, this live preview also reflects the downloaded HTML document and provides colors that represent correct, almost correct, or incorrect answers.

00:33.327 --> 00:41.740
Downloading the HTML, we receive our standalone activity, which maintains all the coloring and functionality of the live preview,

00:42.809 --> 00:46.976
well as a restart button for the student or learner to redo the activity.

00:48.178 --> 00:49.460
Moving to the word search

00:51.137 --> 00:51.618
style.

00:52.098 --> 00:56.425
Three difficulty options, the ability to enable or disable hints,

00:57.112 --> 01:12.417
There is also a regenerate puzzle button which allows you to regenerate the puzzle, changing the locations of the given characters, but also denotes it with a seed so educators can regenerate the same puzzle in the future if it was a successful activity.

01:13.379 --> 01:22.433
Downloading this HTML file downloads the standalone activity and maintains all color and functionality, including a restart button.

01:23.435 --> 01:24.597
An important thing to note

01:24.837 --> 01:25.157
is

01:25.327 --> 01:27.891
Changing between light and dark mode changes

01:28.211 --> 01:30.295
the theme of the activity downloaded.

01:30.535 --> 01:34.461
For instance, if we change to light mode and redownload the Wordle activity,

01:35.551 --> 01:43.564
downloaded will be in light mode, of course, still maintaining the theme and functionality of the same activity in dark mode.

01:44.787 --> 01:47.592
And that concludes the demonstration for Auray.

01:47.832 --> 01:48.313
Thank you.
